**{chosen}**\\\\n- Dev directory: \"'`{base}/`'\"\\\\n- Final HTML: \"'`{base}.html` in workspace root.'\"\\\\n- Exit interview: \"'`exit-interview.json` in workspace root.'\"\\\\n\\\\n## Requirements and decisions\\\\n- Follow TASK.md and PLAN.md. Build an actual new game on the Pavilion engine.\\\\n- Eight narrative campaign cases, all tools, four strains, gifts, Code Blue, local/hub co-op, procedural art/audio, controller-first interface.\\\\n- No subagents. Single self-contained HTML; about-data JSON with full credits and feedback.\\\\n- Testing: one command for deterministic simulations + browser integration; inspect screenshots across sizes and WebKit.\\\\n- Toolkit cheatsheet path is absent; viewport-matrix and Playwright are available.\\\\n\\\\n## Completed\\\\n- Read TASK.md and main design sections.\\\\n- Randomly selected title.\\\\n\\\\n## In progress\\\\n- Read remaining plan and engine docs; fetch engine and hub protocol.\\\\n\\\\n## Remaining\\\\n- Implement simulation, art, UI, story, audio, multiplayer and designer data.\\\\n- Build, test complete campaign and features, inspect layouts, fix issues.\\\\n- Write exact final metadata, exit interview and final response.\\\\n''')\nPath('.game-path').write_text(base)\nprint(base)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
