{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'd=$(cat .game-path); tail -50 \"$d/test-core.log\"; tail -25 \"$d/check-web.log\"'","aggregated_output":"    Blocking waiting for file lock on build directory\n   Compiling pav_core v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261105-015057__x42677a/work/Trauma-Refrain-Third-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-015057/engine/crates/pav_core)\nwarning: unused import: `InputFrame`\n --> crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs:3:20\n  |\n3 | use pav_core::{Sim,InputFrame,SimState};\n  |                    ^^^^^^^^^^\n  |\n  = note: `#[warn(unused_imports)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\n\nerror[E0277]: `&Replay` is not an iterator\n  --> crates/pav_core/tests/surgery.rs:22:65\n   |\n22 |  let mut replay=Sim::new(\"surgery/case/3\",17).unwrap();for f in &a.recording{replay.step(f);}assert_eq!(a.state_hash(),replay.state_...\n   |                                                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^ `&Replay` is not an iterator\n   |\n   = help: the trait `Iterator` is not implemented for `&Replay`\n   = note: required for `&Replay` to implement `IntoIterator`\n\nFor more information about this error, try `rustc --explain E0277`.\nwarning: `pav_core` (test \"surgery\") generated 1 warning\nerror: could not compile `pav_core` (test \"surgery\") due to 1 previous error; 1 warning emitted\n   Compiling bytemuck_derive v1.12.1\n   Compiling thiserror-impl v2.0.21\n   Compiling num-derive v0.5.1\n    Checking bytemuck v1.25.2\n    Checking glam v0.33.11\n    Checking wide v1.7.1\n    Checking naga-types v30.0.1\n    Checking num-complex v0.4.6\n    Checking arrayvec v0.7.8\n    Checking serde_arrays v0.2.0\n    Checking ciborium v0.2.2\n    Checking simba v0.10.2\n   Compiling wasm-bindgen-macro v0.2.129\n    Checking nalgebra v0.35.0\n    Checking js-sys v0.3.106\n    Checking glamx v0.3.1\n    Checking parry3d v0.31.1\n    Checking web-sys v0.3.106\n    Checking wasm-bindgen-futures v0.4.79\n    Checking rapier3d v0.36.0\n    Checking wgpu-types v30.0.1\n    Checking pav_render v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261105-015057__x42677a/work/Trauma-Refrain-Third-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-015057/engine/crates/pav_render)\n    Checking pav_view v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261105-015057__x42677a/work/Trauma-Refrain-Third-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-015057/engine/crates/pav_view)\n    Checking pav_surgery v0.1.0 (/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261105-015057__x42677a/work/Trauma-Refrain-Third-Opinion-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-015057/engine/crates/pav_surgery)\n    Finished `dev` profile [optimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 1m 05s\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
