pline{display:none}body.touch-settings .panel-shell{inset:20px!important;width:auto!important;background:#102b30;padding:20px;border:0}body.touch-settings .panel-shell h2{font-size:44px;margin:10px 0 18px}body.touch-settings .eyebrow{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:3px}body.touch-settings .tabs{gap:4px}body.touch-settings .tabs button{font-size:22px;padding:8px 14px}body.touch-settings .setting-row{font-size:22px;min-height:90px;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px 0}body.touch-settings .setting-row label{min-width:130px}body.touch-settings .setting-row small{font-size:16px;max-width:270px}body.touch-settings .setting-row input[type=range]{width:160px;height:32px}body.touch-settings .setting-row output{font-size:22px;width:50px}body.touch-settings .setting-row .switch{font-size:20px;min-width:110px;padding:10px}body.touch-settings .panel-footer{font-size:20px;gap:10px}body.touch-settings .flat-button{font-size:20px;padding:9px 12px;min-height:48px}}'\"\\\\n''')\np=r/'engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/surgery/mod.rs';s=p.read_text().replace('if self.gift_left==0.{self.surgeons[3].active=false;}','if self.gift_left==0. && self.surgeons[3].ghost{self.surgeons[3].active=false;self.surgeons[3].ghost=false;}')\ns=s.replace('self.surgeons[3].active=true;self.surgeons[3].ghost=true;self.surgeons[3].cursor=p;self.surgeons[3].tool=tool;', 'if \"'!self.surgeons[3].active || self.surgeons[3].ghost {self.surgeons[3].active=true;self.surgeons[3].ghost=true;self.surgeons[3].cursor=p;self.surgeons[3].tool=tool;}'\"')\np.write_text(s)\np=r/'engine/crates/pav_surgery/src/lib.rs';s=p.read_text().replace('for _ in 0..n.min(200000){let mut f=', 'for _ in 0..n.min(200000){if self.sim.outcome()\"'!=pav_core::games::Outcome::Playing{break;}let mut f='\"');p.write_text(s)\nPY\nd=\"'$(cat .game-path); node --check \"$d/web/app.js\"; \"$d/tools/build.sh\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_55","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Implementation checkpoint 2\n- Complete original story: 164 lines in dev/web/story.json, generated by tools/make_story.py (authoring source).\n- HTML shell implements title/main menu, difficulty, story typewriter/auto/backlog, chart, campaign, case files, Code Blue, settings, pause, results/death, 7-page live developer panel, paged About.\n- Browser input: mouse gestures, keyboard-only cursor, DualSense flick selection and analog trigger, four local pad seats; glyph switching. Touch-only controller-required screen and responsive settings.\n- Procedural Web Audio music, heartbeat, tool cues and formant voices; all default bus levels implemented.\n- Hub shared-world host/mirror networking, own ready card, server host, immediate time-up finish and end cleanup implemented, harness pending.\n- Built exact root single HTML (5.69 MiB). tools/build.sh is the build command. Dedicated wasm crate builds successfully.\n- Core suite: 6 tests all passed (cases, idle, whole-campaign feature coverage, snapshots/replays, wrong-tool/checkpoint, content).\n- Chromium boot rendered real WebGPU pixels with zero console/page errors. Visually inspected title and operation PNGs in dev/tests/out/: readable at 1920x1080, clear original tissue/tools and surgical HUD.\n- Browser rendering is expensive on SwiftShader; expose __game.do({render:false}) for logic tests while retaining actual graphics for visual captures. No performance requirement; no reduction to game art planned.\n- Current build running after small improvements (precision input, four-seat Echo safety, story reveal fix, main menu spacing, mobile settings).\n- Still required: consolidated test runner, controller/mouse/audio/persistence/mobile/browser checks, hub harness + actual input sync, designer docs, final feedback JSON, clean build artifacts and final handoff.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
